{"name":"Shawarma Wraps","permalink":"shawarma-wraps","edit":"https://github.com/The-Silverwood-Institute/Recibase/tree/master/src/main/scala/se/reciba/api/recibase/recipes/ShawarmaWraps.scala","source":"Sylvia","description":"Roasted sweet potato, red pepper and veggie mince with eastern spices in a wrap","tagline":null,"notes":["It might be useful mix the vegetables with oil and spices in a large bowl."],"dated_notes":[],"tags":["Vegan-ish","Scales"],"inherited_tags":["Pescatarian","Vegetarian-ish","Vegetarian"],"image":null,"ingredients_blocks":[{"name":null,"ingredients":[{"name":"Sweet Potato","quantity":"1","prep":"cut into 2cm wedges","notes":null},{"name":"Red Pepper","quantity":"1","prep":"sliced","notes":null},{"name":"Red Onion","quantity":"1","prep":"thinly sliced","notes":null},{"name":"Vivera Plant-Based Shawarma Kebab","quantity":"1","prep":"175g","notes":null},{"name":"Garlic","quantity":"3 cloves","prep":"sliced","notes":null},{"name":"Wraps","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Siracha Sauce","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":"Optional"},{"name":"Yoghurt","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":"Optional"},{"name":"Mayonaise","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":"Optional"},{"name":"Fresh coriander","quantity":"10g","prep":"chopped","notes":null},{"name":"Olive Oil","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Salt","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Pepper","quantity":null,"prep":null,"notes":null}]},{"name":"Shawarma Spice mix","ingredients":[{"name":"Cumin","quantity":"1/2 tsp","prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Ground Coriander","quantity":"1/2 tsp","prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Smoked Paprika","quantity":"1/2 tsp","prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Ground Cinnamon","quantity":"1/4 tsp","prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Allspice","quantity":"1/4 tsp","prep":null,"notes":null},{"name":"Cayenne Pepper","quantity":"1/4 tsp","prep":null,"notes":null}]}],"method":["Preheat the oven to 200°C (390°F, gas mark 6).","Start with sweet potatoes because they take the longest to roast.","Spread the sweet potatoes out on a large roasting tray then drizzle with olive oil, the spice mix, salt and pepper. Roast for 30-40 minutes.","Repeat the process for the red pepper, red onion and garlic. Roasting them for 20-30 minutes.","Shortly before serving, heat up the shawarma kebab pieces in the oven for 5 minutes.","Microwave the wraps per packet instructions.","If you're using mayonaise then mix it with siracha.","Spread siracha mayonaise or yoghurt on the wraps then add the roasted vegetables and mince. Garnish with fresh coriander."]}